{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47102","headline":"冬暮送人 · 尚颜","name":"冬暮送人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安冬欲尽，又送一遗贤。\n醉後情浑可，言休理不然。\n射衣秦岭雪，摇月汉江船。\n亦过春兼夏，回期信有蝉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}